    "reviews": "\u201cTRON: Identity is a smart and respectful use of the classic series, turning it into a gripping sci-fi detective story.\u201d<br>4/5 \u2013 Digital Trends<br><br>\u201cThought provoking writing and incredible music are coupled with an enjoyable card game in a tale that tackles new frontiers in the world of Tron which will be essential for those that \u2018fight for the user\u2019.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Finger Guns<br><br>\u201cTRON: Identity is not only for TRON fans. This is a great jumping on point!\u201d<br>Hard Drive<br>",
